n is among the top five  exporters of goods around the world and  if mount fuji set japan's electronics  and automobile experts back  other countries could take their place  this could be huge for china and germany  who are also big exporters of  electronics worldwide  japan could suffer billions of dollars  in economic losses  but  things could always be worse  like the entire ring of fire could erupt  all at the same time  but  that's a story  for another  what if
 

